---
import Container from "./Container.astro";
---

<section id="faq" class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-32">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-center">
    Frequently Asked Questions
  </h1>
  <p class="text-center text-xl text-balance font-thin">
    Everything you need to know about Finon. Don’t see your question? <a
      class="underline"
      href="/support">Contact us</a
    > .
  </p>

  <Container>
    <div
      class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 dark:bg-black border border-base-300"
    >
      <input type="radio" name="my-accordion-2" checked="checked" />
      <h4 class="collapse-title font-semibold">Which account can I connect?</h4>
      <p class="collapse-content text-sm">
        We're starting with the UK's most popular banks and exchanges. We are
        expanding this list every month based on waitlist user requests, see our
        current connections <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1pqarJN8L3lZzMCyd4eQht-kttXtz7582prEfZoM1GZM/edit?usp=sharing"
          class="underline"
          target="_blank">here</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 dark:bg-black border border-base-300"
    >
      <input type="radio" name="my-accordion-2" />
      <h4 class="collapse-title font-semibold">
        What account types do you support?
      </h4>
      <p class="collapse-content text-sm">
        We currently support bank accounts, crypto exchanges, and stock
        platforms. We are actively working to expand into other asset classes
        like pensions, commodities, and real estate.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
